{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","星体燃炽"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤“恒星”并激发场上所有“恒星”造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使用终极技能时消耗600点能量，选择1个地图格，在对应位置召唤1颗“恒星”，对周围1格范围内的敌人造成360% + 30% ATK伤害。随后激发自身的所有“恒星”，使每颗“恒星”对其周围1格范围内的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害，并眩晕2秒。被激发的“恒星”会进入燃烧状态6秒，期间每秒对周围1格范围内的敌人造成36% + 6% ATK伤害。最多召唤3颗“恒星”。召唤新的“恒星”时，若数量已达上限，则优先替换范围内敌人数量最少的且持续时间最长的“恒星”。每个地图格只能存在1颗自身的“恒星”，自动释放该技能时，将会优先选择敌人最密集且不与自身其它“恒星”重叠的地图格。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":55,"end":61,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":107,"end":113,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":164,"end":169,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":103,"end":117,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":161,"end":173,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“恒星”激发伤害提升至270% + 30% ATK，燃烧伤害提高至每秒42% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“恒星”激发伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK，燃烧伤害提高至每秒48% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“恒星”激发伤害提升至330% + 30% ATK，燃烧伤害提高至每秒54% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","“恒星”激发伤害提升至360% + 30% ATK，燃烧伤害提高至每秒60% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","引力坍缩"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤“行星”围绕“恒星”盘旋；主动释放时牵引敌人并造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，每次召唤“恒星”时，在其相邻格生成1颗“行星”，优先生成在相邻格内生命值最低的敌人所在格。并对该格子上的敌人造成120% ATK伤害。“行星”会以6秒一周的速度围绕对应的“恒星”盘旋，对碰撞到的敌人造成90% ATK伤害，每名敌人每3秒最多受到1次该伤害。每当“行星”完成一周盘旋时，对中心格内的敌人造成180% ATK伤害。主动释放时，操控场上所有“恒星”与“黑洞”，牵引其周围2格范围内的敌人至最近的“恒星”或“黑洞”，并造成270% + 30% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":223,"end":229,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":60,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":105,"end":112,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":156,"end":164,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":219,"end":233,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","牵引伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","牵引伤害提升至330% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","牵引伤害提升至360% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","暗芒脉冲"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","向敌人数量最多的3条直线发射脉冲射线造成伤害，并基于实际伤害获得护盾。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","分别从3个方向朝覆盖敌人最多的轴线发射脉冲射线，对命中的敌人造成210% + 30% ATK伤害，并获得等同于本技能实际伤害总量90% + 9%的护盾，持续9秒。脉冲射线每次命中敌人时，还会额外击破其护盾，单次最多击破270% + 30% ATK的护盾值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":67,"end":72,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":113,"end":119,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":109,"end":123,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至240% + 30% ATK，击破护盾值提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":32,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":28,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至270% + 30% ATK，击破护盾值提升至330% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":32,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":28,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK，击破护盾值提升至360% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":32,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":28,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提升自身攻击力，召唤“恒星”后额外提升攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升2%的攻击力，每次召唤“恒星”时，额外增加2%的攻击力，最多提升6%。将“恒星”转化为“黑洞”后，额外提升6%的攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升4%的攻击力，每次召唤“恒星”时，额外增加4%的攻击力，最多提升12%。将“恒星”转化为“黑洞”后，额外提升9%的攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升6%的攻击力，每次召唤“恒星”时，额外增加6%的攻击力，最多提升18%。将“恒星”转化为“黑洞”后，额外提升12%的攻击力。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","万星归渊"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","将“恒星”转化为“黑洞”，“黑洞”持续造成真实伤害并永久抽取敌人的攻击力和急速。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自身召唤的“恒星”数量达到3颗后，将自身的所有“恒星”永久转化为“黑洞”，并吞噬环绕其运动的“行星”。此后通过“星体燃炽”召唤的“恒星”将直接以“黑洞”形态生成。“黑洞”初始每秒对周围1格范围内的敌人造成30% ATK外加目标最大生命值2%的真实伤害（总计不超过60% ATK）。“星体燃炽”激发“黑洞”时，不再使其燃烧，而是使每个“黑洞”分别从范围内的每名敌人处抽取其30%的攻击力和30点急速，敌人失去的属性分别转化为所有“黑洞”的伤害提升和持续伤害频率提升，攻击力提升和持续伤害频率提升的上限分别为60%和60%。且单个敌人因该效果损失的攻击力，累计最高不超过星初始攻击力的60%。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":102,"end":109,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":131,"end":138,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“黑洞”对范围内目标造成的真实伤害提高至60% ATK外加目标最大生命值4%（总计不超过120% ATK）。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":44,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“黑洞”对范围内目标造成的真实伤害提高至90% ATK外加目标最大生命值6%（总计不超过180% ATK）。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":44,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","释放“星体燃炽”激发“黑洞”时，额外对范围内的敌人造成180% ATK真实伤害。敌方英雄在“黑洞”范围内被击败时，“黑洞”会将其吞噬，并为星额外回复333点能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","强化“引力坍缩”的牵引范围和自身回能效率，在“恒星”转化为“黑洞”时进入高维空间，永久处于无敌状态。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“引力坍缩”的牵引范围拓展至3格。在将“恒星”转化为“黑洞”前，自身回能效率提高60%；成功转化时，自身会进入高维空间，永久处于无敌状态，直至战斗中的计入存活的友方英雄仅剩处于此状态的星。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":66,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","暗质星团"]]}